 "notes": "Sparse map of the Kostrena house reef in front of Diving Center Kostrena (OpenStreetMap), used here because the site coordinates are a general Kostrena point 1.8 km east. The reef is a plateau from 0.5 to 12 m and then a steep reef to about 40 m, the edge some 15-20 m off the shore (dckostrena.hr, ScubaBoard trip report 2009); the edge is drawn along the OSM shoreline. The wooden wreck is taken to be the 'Schooner Kostrena' listed by krnicadive.com (42 x 9.4 m, 555 GRT, sunk in bad weather, 29-42 m); its position is not published, so it is marked as an indicative point on the slope below the dive centre and no hull is drawn.",
